      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GO GO CAMBLA (1) jumps from the inside draw. Latest effort finished 2nd over 390m at Q Lakeside beaten 3 lengths (22.18) behind Lakoda Focus in a Mix 5 on October 30. Looks well placed here and rates a key player. Expected to be in the finish. PENNY DAZE (2) was in winning form two back (23.84) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 7th. Form here at the trip sound including 10 wins. Comes through a solid form race last start. Expected to run well. CAMBLA BLAZE (5) turned in a solid run last start over 390m at Q Lakeside finishing 4th and beaten only 2.75 lengths (21.90). Has a good record here at this journey. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. ANOTHER MEGHAN (7) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
